{"id":"b4923b63c348b8a7","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-jonsson-lemma.md","title":"thm-jonsson-lemma","display":"thm-jonsson-lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]"],"display":"thm-jonsson-lemma","label":"93-thm-jonsson-lemma","aliases":["93-thm-jonsson-lemma"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e317109be82f65fa\" href=\"?note=e317109be82f65fa\" title=\"93-df-congruence-distributive\">93-df-congruence-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jonsson-lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-jonsson-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-jonsson-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-jonsson-lemma-thm-jonsson-lemma\">thm-jonsson-lemma <code>thm-jonsson-lemma</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm H_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm S_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm S_{\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}\\)</span> are the exact closure operators of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>；此条件同时约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> 与类型索引闭包算子的调用，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal K=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时仍须单独给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm H_{\\tau}(\\mathrm S_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm H_{\\tau}(\\mathrm S_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Jónsson's lemma uses ultraproduct closure, not arbitrary direct-product closure at the innermost step. The exact locally defined operators replace the unsupported <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}_U\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}_U\\)</span> abbreviation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-jonsson-lemma-thm-jonsson-lemma","text":"thm-jonsson-lemma `thm-jonsson-lemma`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"e317109be82f65fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-closure-operators]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ is from [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm H_{\\tau}$, $\\mathrm S_{\\tau}$, and $\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}$ are the exact closure operators of [[93-df-closure-operators]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm H_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm S_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K);\\tau)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm H_{\\tau}(\\mathrm S_{\\tau}(\\mathrm P_{U,\\tau}(\\mathcal K))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HSP}_U","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f0b0edbaa6696a1d","e317109be82f65fa","97b46a497e251f9f",